    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Martin O'Connor Estate Agents are delighted to present to the market No. 37 Doire Fea, a beautifully presented four-bedroom home offering generous accommodation over three floors in one of Moycullen's most attractive residential developments.\n\nExtending to approximately 160.3 sq.m. (1,725 sq.ft.), the property is bright, spacious and exceptionally well laid out, with generous living accommodation at ground-floor level and four well-proportioned bedrooms arranged across the upper floors.\n\nThe entrance hall leads to a comfortable living room where an electric feature fireplace provides an attractive focal point. Double doors open through to the kitchen/dining area at the rear, creating a lovely flow between the two main living spaces. The kitchen is fitted with an excellent selection of units and offers plenty of room for family dining and entertaining, with doors opening directly onto the rear garden. A separate utility room and guest W.C. complete the ground floor.\n\nOn the first floor are three well-proportioned bedrooms, one of which is currently used as a home office, giving purchasers the flexibility to retain a dedicated workspace if required. An en-suite shower room and separate shower room also serve this level.\n\nThe second floor is occupied by the impressive principal bedroom, a particularly spacious room with ample space for additional bedroom furniture and a seating or dressing area. A walk-in wardrobe and private en-suite shower room complete the accommodation on this level.\n\nNo. 37 boasts an impressive A2 BER rating, offering excellent energy efficiency and helping to keep day-to-day running costs to a minimum. The property benefits from an air-to-water heat pump system, underfloor heating at ground-floor level, high-output radiators on the upper floors and a whole-house mechanical ventilation system. These energy-efficient features formed an important part of the original specification within Doire Fea.\n\nOutside, the rear garden is a real feature of the property. Beautifully maintained and thoughtfully landscaped, it features a paved patio, gravelled areas and an attractive selection of mature shrubs and colourful planting. There is ample space for outdoor dining and entertaining, while a Steeltech garden shed provides practical additional storage. To the front, a paved driveway provides off-street parking.\n\nDoire Fea is an attractive, well-established development with generous open green space and the mature woodland of Killrainey Woods forming a wonderful backdrop. The development enjoys an excellent position close to the heart of Moycullen, combining a pleasant residential setting with the convenience of village life. Originally developed as a niche scheme of just 50 homes, it has matured into a particularly appealing residential setting.\n\nMoycullen offers an excellent range of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, sporting facilities and everyday amenities. Galway City is approximately 10 km away, making the property an excellent option for those commuting to the city, while the N59 provides easy access west towards Oughterard, Lough Corrib and the wider Connemara region.\n\nWith generous accommodation, an impressive A2 BER rating, a beautifully landscaped rear garden and a superb location close to the centre of Moycullen, No. 37 Doire Fea is an exceptional family home offering space, comfort and convenience within easy reach of Galway City."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nBright and welcoming entrance hall providing access to the principal ground-floor accommodation, with staircase leading to the upper floors and a practical under-stairs area for hanging coats and additional storage.\n\nLiving Room - \nComfortable and well-proportioned living room with excellent natural light, featuring an electric feature fireplace and double doors leading through to the kitchen/dining area.\n\nKitchen / Dining Area - \nBright and spacious kitchen/dining area fitted with a selection of wall and base units, complemented by ample worktop space and tiled splashback. Generous dining area with plenty of room for a family dining table, with double doors connecting through to the living room and direct access to the rear garden, creating an excellent space for everyday family living and entertaining.\n\nUtility Room - \nPractical utility room located just off the kitchen/dining area, offering additional storage and laundry space.\n\nGuest W.C. - \nGround-floor guest W.C. fitted with toilet and wash-hand basin.\n\nFirst Floor Landing - \n\n\nBedroom 1/Office - \nA versatile room offering excellent flexibility for use as a bedroom, home office or study, particularly suited to those working from home overlooking the rear garden.\n\nBedroom 2 - \nBright and well-proportioned double bedroom with built-in wardrobes providing excellent storage and a large window allowing for plenty of natural light.\n\nShower Room - \nSpacious and well-appointed shower room comprising a large glazed walk-in shower, toilet and wash-hand basin. Finished with contemporary tiling, with a window providing natural light.\n\nBedroom 3 - \nAttractive double bedroom with built-in wardrobes and a large window providing excellent natural light. A well-proportioned room with ample space for additional bedroom furniture.\n\nEnsuite Shower - \nContemporary en-suite comprising a shower enclosure, toilet and wash-hand basin, finished with tiled flooring and feature wall tiling.\n\nSecond Floor Landing - \n\n\nPrincipal Bedroom - \nAn impressive and exceptionally spacious principal bedroom occupying the second floor, offering generous space for additional bedroom furniture and a seating area, with the added benefit of a walk-in wardrobe and private en-suite shower room.\n\nEn-Suite Shower - \nSpacious en-suite comprising a large glazed shower enclosure, W.C. and wash-hand basin, finished with contemporary tiled flooring and feature wall tiling.\n\nGarden Shed - \nSteeltech garden shed with non-drip sheeting, providing useful additional outdoor storage.\n\n"
      },
      {
